%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see. That's good.\d%K%P
「是吗…太好了」%K%P
That was probably because...%K%P
那一定是…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, Osamu.\d%K%P
「呐，理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes?\d%K%P
「什么？」%K%P
Mitoko was the most important person in my life -- my\nnumber one. The girl who was -my- very own guardian.%K%P
美都子是最重要的。\n对我这个监护人来说，她比谁都重要。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAre you... with Himeo right now?\d%K%P
