%LC美都子
\dWhat about Himeo...?\d%K%P
「姫绪姐她…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe's normally asleep around this time, right? I didn't\nwant to disturb her, so I'll just come pick her up\ntomorrow.\d%K%P
「她啊…现在已经睡了吧？\n现在被叫起来太可怜了，明天还得…」%K%P
I would return to my room and face the new day as if\nnothing had happened.%K%P
就这样回到公寓，\n就当一切都没有发生，如此这般迎来明天吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's no good. You can't leave her all alone like that.\d%K%P
