And seeing how Himeo herself was an adult... Come\ntomorrow, she would likely also treat me as if nothing had\nhappened.%K%P
对啊，她已经不是小孩了…\n到了明天，一定会一如往常地对待我吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, I'll be fine. You should stay by her side for the\nnight. I think she needs you more than I do right now.\d%K%P
「行了…快到她身边去吧。\n让姫绪姐安心」%K%P
All I had to say when I met her tomorrow was...%K%P
所以我，一开口就这么说吧：%K%P
\dGood morning. Yesterday was rough, but you did well.\n...By the way, I hope you haven't forgotten to take your\nhangover medicine.\d%K%P
『您早上好。昨天辛苦您了。\n…那个，醒酒药吃了吗？抵抗宿醉的药』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't do that... Mitoko.\d%K%P
「我做不到啊…美都子」%K%P
And she would answer like this...%K%P
那样的话，她就会说：%K%P
\dWasn't it your responsibility to drink all the alcohol in\nmy stead? ...You truly are one useless secretary.\d%K%P
『酒不是应该你全都挡下的吗？\n…真是个废物秘书』%K%P
And with that, we would be back to normal.%K%P
过不了几秒，我们的对话就会恢复到一如往常。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy? Don't do this to her. I mean, Himeo... I think she\nactually lo--\d%K%P
「为什么？那她岂不是太可怜了吗。\n因为姬绪姐，其实对理君…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI mean, I think I might be in love with her.\d%K%P
「因为我，好像喜欢上她了」%K%P
