%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...! I'm fairly certain we've already said goodnight to\neach other.\d%K%P
「哎…\n『晚安』已经说过了吧？」%K%P
I could see Himeo's eyes through the slit in the chain-\nlocked door -- she must have been crying.%K%P
门上了锁，从门缝里所见的姫绪小姐，\n眼睛已经哭得红肿了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry, but this is an emergency. There's something I\nhave to confirm with you today.\d%K%P
