「什么啊…\n够了，让我一个人待会儿…」%K%P
Her voice sounded pitifully hoarse as well; just imagining\nhow desperately she must have cried while I was gone made\nmy heart ache.%K%P
她的声音也渐渐地嘶哑了，\n在那之后，不知她又哭号了多久，\n只是想象一下，就让我痛彻心扉。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAbout what we heard on that recorder...\d%K%P
