%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
No more running. Not for her -- or me.%K%P
可是，已经无路可逃了。\n不管是姫绪小姐，还是我。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou can laugh it all off if you want. I mean, none of it\nis true, anyway. Or if you can't stand to listen to it,\njust cover your ears. But as for me... I want to listen to\nthe whole thing.\d%K%P
「你要是想笑就笑吧。因为那都是谎言。\n不想听把耳朵堵上也行。\n可是我，想听听那之后的话」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhat the hell are you talking about? There's no way I'm\ndoing that. Are you out of your mind?\d%K%P
