%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSorry? You don't seem the least apologetic to me! Not one\nbit!\d%K%P
「你啊，一点儿都不觉得丢人吗！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, you're being too loud...\d%K%P
