Himeo's voice escaped through the gap, and could be heard\nreverberating across the entire floor.%K%P
从张开的门缝隙间中，姫绪小姐的喊叫声，\n大到前厅里都清楚可闻。%K%P
If anyone who attended the party was around to hear this,\nthe rumors about our relationship would spread all\nthroughout the conglomerate at record speeds. And not the\nsilly kind of rumors, either.%K%P
若是今晚宴会的某位与会者经过，\n我们之间剪不乱理还乱的关系，传到泽嶋集团里面，也不足为奇。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dBut why?! You don't even care about me!\d%K%P
「为什么啊！\n你明明都不把我放在眼里！」%K%P
But Himeo seemed to have forgotten all that for the\nmoment, her mind entirely focused on our present\nrelationship.%K%P
可是现在的姫绪小姐，完全抛却了大小姐的面子，\n全心全意地专注于与我的关系中。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm begging you. Please let me listen to that recording\nagain.\d%K%P
