%LCHimeo
%LC姫緒
\dA... Ah...\d%K%P
「啊…啊啊…」%K%P
If that was the case, then I too would forget the rest of\nthe world for a moment.%K%P
因为我的眼中，只有眼前的这个女人了。%K%P
