%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐…」%K%P
I wanted to hear her affectionately utter my name.%K%P
我想再听一遍…\n姫绪小姐，深情地呼唤着我的声音。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dListening to false confessions will only make you feel\nempty inside.\d%K%P
