%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dLie or not, it made me happy. And nothing will change\nthat.\d%K%P
「就算是虚假的，但我还是很开心」%K%P
I wanted to hear Himeo confess her feelings about me\nagain.%K%P
我想再听一遍…\n姫绪小姐，对我的好意毫不掩饰的声音。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
