%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs that...\d%K%P
「那个…」%K%P
Himeo drew closer to me again, quickly closing the\ndistance between us.%K%P
姬绪小姐…\n又一次拷问着我们的距离。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dListening to the rest of it means you'll have to accept\nwhatever I say on that recording.\d%K%P
