I knew she was the type reluctant to ever back down,\nbut...%K%P
自己一度说出的话，\n绝对没有再否定的道理。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAnd if you do give me an answer, I'll end up wanting to\nbelieve it's the truth.\d%K%P
