She would always justify herself with faulty logic she\ncame up on the spot, but...%K%P
净是捏造些歪理，\n她真是会给自己的行为找理由的一个人啊。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAnd then, regardless of whether or not this was all true,\nour feelings in that moment will turn into a truth we\nwon't be able to deny.\d%K%P
