She would end up believing her own lies, refusing to\nlisten to anything she didn't like, but...%K%P
自己说的谎言，自己又去相信，\n自己否定的事实，自己却又不信，\n她真是个相当矛盾的人啊。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDo you still want to hear it...?\d%K%P
「即便那样…也好吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOf course.\d%K%P
「那当然了」%K%P
... I had completely fallen for it, finding that trait of\nhers more and more endearing as time passed.%K%P
这份深厚的爱意…\n不知何时，让我已经不能自拔了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll believe everything you say, even if you claim\nthey're false.\d%K%P
「你说什么，我都相信。\n说谎之类的话，没有信用」%K%P
It might not have made much sense when spoken out loud,\nbut we both understood what it meant as we exchanged our\nwordless promise.%K%P
意义不明的对话，\n却成了我们二人的誓言。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThere will be... no turning back, you know? I'll... end\nup getting the wrong idea.\d%K%P
