%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「抱歉」%K%P
In sharp contrast with her indignant facial expression,\nHimeo's voice was filled with mirth.%K%P
与怒气冲冲的表情相反，\n姫绪小姐的声音在颤抖。%K%P
It now sounded a lot more like what I'd heard on that\nrecorder.%K%P
和ＩＣ录音机里听到的声音，\n和那个声音何其酷似。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThen please hear me out. I'll... bare my true feelings\nfor you.\d%K%P
