Her very own words had put a stop at the end of all this.%K%P
然后，\n她下定决心，说出了决定性的一句话。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d\dHe's terrible. The worst man I'd ever met. He doesn't\ncare who or what I am, not even in the slightest.\d\d%K%P
