%LC姫绪
\d\dStill... I don't know why, but when I'm in front of him,\nI always start feeling like a clueless child. I can't\nimpose my rules on him. Instead, I end up being completely\noverwhelmed by his rules.\d\d%K%P
『可是为什么，我在他面前，只是一个笨手笨脚的学生啊。\n进退失据，完全被他玩弄于鼓掌之中』%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dH-Hahh... ahh... nmh... Hahh.. Haahhh...\d%K%P
