%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d\dI have not been this humiliated in my entire life. He\nmade me realize that I understood nothing, and that all I\never prided myself on was useless.\d\d%K%P
『那是我直到如今的人生中，最大的屈辱。\n我深刻地体会到自己有多么一无所知，\n自己有多么无用』%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHahh... Hahh... Hahh... U-Ubwh...\d%K%P
「哈啊、哈啊、哈啊…呜、呜噗…」%K%P
