「呜、呜嗯、不是、不是那样的。\n只是…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dJust...?\d%K%P
「只是？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d\dBut no matter how useless I was, he never abandoned\nme.\d\d%K%P
『可是他…并没有丢下那样不中用的我』%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
